<title>UK: ARGENTABANK SETS 2.0 BLN LUX FRANC FIVE-YEAR BOND.</title>
<headline>ARGENTABANK SETS 2.0 BLN LUX FRANC FIVE-YEAR BOND.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager BCEE.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AGENTABANK LUXEMBOURG S.A.</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  ARGENTA SPAARBANK (ANTWERP)</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     5.0	 MATURITY    12.SEP.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    12.SEP.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K)  100</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.50	SELL CONC  =	   PRAECIPUUM  0.25</p>
<p> NOTES	SENIOR, UNSECURED AND UNSUBORDINATED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
